Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(run): route jobs to backend plugins by label

Labels are parsed with the configured plugins, so a runner declares and
registers "small" for "small:k8s:/podspecs/small.yaml" and picks the plugin
for a job whose first matching runs-on entry is a plugin label.

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5

